
# <type>(<scope>)!: <subject>
#
# <body: why this change was made; wrap at 72 characters>
#
# <footers>
#
# ── Rules ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Header:  72 characters max. Subject: imperative, lowercase, no period.
# Types:   feat fix docs refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# Scopes:  repo dev ci deps docs safety-layer adapters orchestrator
#          improver chat evals deploy, or any habit/adapter directory name
# Breaking change: add "!" before ":" and a "BREAKING CHANGE:" footer.
# Footers: Refs: #123 | BREAKING CHANGE: ... | Co-Authored-By: ...
#
# Example:
#   feat(safety-layer): enforce per-session write budgets
#
# See CONTRIBUTING.md#commit-messages
